---
permalink: /members/awards/
layout: base.njk
title: "Awards | POAP KINGS | A Clash Royale Clan with Proof"
description: "Season-by-season awards for POAP KINGS — war champs, donation champs, rookie MVPs, and weekly honors."
navActive: members
---
<section class="pageIntro card">
  <a class="memberBackLink" href="/members/">← Members</a>
  <h1 class="pageTitle">Clan Awards</h1>
  <p class="sectionDesc">
    Every season POAP KINGS honors members for their war contributions, donations, and consistency. Browse winners season by season.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="card card-padded">
    <h2 class="sectionTitle m-0 mb-md">Seasons</h2>
    <ul class="awardsSeasonList">
      {% for season in awards.seasons %}
      {%- set inProgress = not season.byType.war_champ or season.byType.war_champ.length == 0 -%}
      <li class="awardsSeasonList__item">
        <a class="awardsSeasonList__link" href="/members/awards/s{{ season.season_id }}/">
          <div class="awardsSeasonList__heading">
            <span class="awardsSeasonList__id">Season {{ season.season_id }}</span>
            {% if inProgress %}<span class="awardsSeasonList__pill awardsSeasonList__pill--live">In progress</span>{% endif %}
          </div>
          <div class="awardsSeasonList__meta">
            {{ season.season_start | formatDate }} – {{ season.season_end | formatDate }} · {{ season.awardCount }} award{{ "s" if season.awardCount != 1 }}
          </div>
          {% if season.byType.war_champ and season.byType.war_champ.length %}
          <div class="awardsSeasonList__champs">
            War Champs: {% for a in season.byType.war_champ %}{{ a.player_name | e }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}
          </div>
          {% endif %}
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
